# Pairs with GateOwnership. A gate leaked by a finished split refuses every later split of the leaf.
MODULE: ForegroundKeepsGate
TARGET: GateOwnership
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the foreground split returns without releasing B's split gate
PERTURBS: ForegroundRelease

--- FIND
    /\ fg = "release"
    /\ gate' = [gate EXCEPT !["B"] = "free"]
--- REPLACE
    /\ fg = "release"
    \* MUTATION: the gate is kept
    /\ gate' = gate
--- END
